   Waveform glow & rounded spectrum bar design patterns
   https://github.com/gauravk95/audio-visualizer-android

10. **Paperize** (MIT License)
   Dynamic wallpaper dominant-color extraction concept
   https://github.com/rajarsheechatterjee/paperize
